[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:A Car Crash]
[00:00.86]Lesson 87 | 第87课
[00:02.78]A car crash | 一场车祸
[00:05.02]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:10.76]Can the mechanics repair Mr. Wood's car? | 机械师能修好伍德先生的车吗？
[00:16.26]Is my car ready yet? | 我的车修好了吗？
[00:19.76]I don't know, sir. | 我不知道，先生。
[00:22.06]What's the number of your car? | 您的车牌号是多少？
[00:25.14]It's LFZ 312 G. | 是 LFZ 312 G。
[00:31.96]When did you bring it to us? | 您什么时候把它送来的？
[00:34.94]I brought it here three days ago. | 我三天前把它送来的。
[00:38.91]Ah yes, I remember now. | 啊，是的，我现在想起来了。
[00:42.56]Have your mechanics finished yet? | 您的机械师修好了吗？
[00:46.00]No, they're still working on it. | 没有，他们还在修。
[00:49.32]Let's go into the garage and have a look at it. | 我们去车库看看吧。
[00:54.84]Isn't that your car? | 那不是你的车吗？
[00:58.13]Well, it was my car. | 嗯，那是我的车。
[01:02.24]Didn't you have a crash? | 你没有出车祸吗？
[01:04.82]That's right. | 是的。
[01:06.78]I drove it into a lamp-post. | 我把它撞到了路灯柱上。
[01:10.06]Can your mechanics repair it? | 你的机械师能修好它吗？
[01:13.20]Well, they're trying to repair it, sir. | 嗯，先生，他们正在努力修。
[01:17.02]But to tell you the truth, you need a new car! | 但说实话，你需要一辆新车了！